values ('f2a3b4c5-6d7e-4f20-9a90-0b1c2d3e4f20', 'philosophy-of-mind', 'Philosophy of Mind', 'Philosophy of Mind examines consciousness, mental states, intentionality, selfhood, agency, perception, emotion, cognition, artificial intelligence, and the relation between mind, brain, body, language, and world. Students reconstruct major arguments, evaluate theories of mind, use empirical work carefully, and write rigorous philosophical analyses of live debates about persons, machines, animals, and mental life.');

